      "verdict": "QUALIFIED_INTRINSIC_COMPLETE1",
      "positive": "Recognizable dark metal and teal side rings, pale central cross and paired upper panels preserve generated metal relief. Full Source outline and dark attached terminal are restored; all4 exact green253/red252 marker cells survive at all4, and x9..14,y36..38 remains occupied with row39 transparent.",
