      "verdict": "QUALIFIED_INTRINSIC_COMPLETE2",
      "positive": "Both authentic trail phases now survive at native1; whole ship steel body, dark square vent, circular black feature, rust mark and teal banding remain recognizable, with generated rivets/plates/shading visible at2\u20134. Full Source phase alpha399 changed cells is exact rather than relying on generated hairline trails.",
      "qualifications": "Thin trails become deliberately crisp logical-cell streaks, with repeated bounded donor texture where Original-supported gaps were filled. The gray hull is cleaner/brighter and its vent/circle more regular than Original. Shared body material is coherent across both frames; scene movement/scale/layer or natural reachability not yet approved."
    },
    {
