      ],
      "verdict": "QUALIFIED_INTRINSIC_COMPLETE2",
      "positive": "Fixed whole-frame registration preserves the large red lens above the dark gray aperture, warm central plate, steel annulus and side supports. Generated relief remains at2\u20134. Authentic16-cell alpha phase difference is preserved, while fullSource x0 stays empty at every scale and no detached stripe remains.",
      "qualifications": "At native1 the Original white lens sparkle is softer, while the lens remains visibly red and separate from the lower dark opening. Bronze plate/bolts are more regular and bright than Original; SourceNN ring contour exposes hard stairs at enlarged view. Both complete frames share coherent registration and no body stretch is introduced by observed stray-alpha bounds."
    }
